{
  "project": {
    "name": "Wide-Mouth Jar Adapter",
    "slug": "jar-adapter",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "Cross-links the mason-jar family with the PCO-1881 bottle family. Screw the adapter onto a standard mason jar (70 mm regular-mouth or ~83 mm wide-mouth continuous thread) and it presents a PCO-1881 MALE stub on top, so any PCO-1881 cap, coupler or spout fits a mason jar. Also generates a plain mason sealing lid and a perforated sifter/shaker lid. Two real helical threads — a coarse mason-jar female thread and a PCO-1881 male thread. Mates the bottle-thread, bird-feeder, faircap-filter and pet-dispenser cartridges via the PCO stub.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Enlaza la familia de frascos mason con la familia de botellas PCO-1881. Enrosca el adaptador en un frasco mason estándar (70 mm boca regular o ~83 mm boca ancha, rosca continua) y presenta un vástago MACHO PCO-1881 arriba, de modo que cualquier tapa, acoplador o boquilla PCO-1881 encaja en un frasco mason. También genera una tapa de sellado mason simple y una tapa espolvoreadora perforada. Dos roscas helicoidales reales — una rosca hembra mason gruesa y una rosca macho PCO-1881. Conecta los cartuchos bottle-thread, bird-feeder, faircap-filter y pet-dispenser mediante el vástago PCO.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/jar-adapter.webp",
